<title>USA: Asbury Park BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Asbury Park BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $12.920 million of Asbury Park Board of Education, N.J., various unlimited tax school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.575 percent.</p>
</text>
